00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:16.250
And people are excited about that and it's
like, man, this is so cool.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:19.150
If it's this exciting to learn, I want to
learn.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.280
If my teacher's always learning, what if I
learn like he learns.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.300
What if I learn like she learns?

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.000
Man, I want to learn some more.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.760
So you got to be a great student in order
for you to be a great teacher.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.379
And last but not least, last but not least.

00:04:30.379 --> 00:04:34.740
Every time if you want your students to be
wanting to learn more and more and more, you

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:38.310
